-      "value": "IAPMEI's public pages list Espaço Empresa business support, the StartUP Voucher Innovate 2025-2026 and StartUP Boost programmes, StartUP Visa and Tech Visa for founders and tech workers, a national mentors network, and a network of Digital Innovation Hubs for digital transformation. Its funding pages list Portugal 2030 and PRR incentives, with open calls on its Concursos abertos page. The page names no AI programme and no Algarve-specific one. Its open-calls page is an index that points to the Portugal 2030 annual call plan (portugal2030.pt/plano-anual-de-avisos/) and the PRR call plan, which we have not read, with PRR digital transition lines under C16 Empresas 4.0.",
