-      "label": "Funding calls planned: AI and innovation, and the Algarve's place in them",
-      "value": "Portugal 2030's annual call plan (September 2026 to August 2027, spreadsheet version of 14 September 2026) lists 177 planned calls worth about 2.04 billion euros. Only seven have a title or objective that mentions AI, digital or IT-type words, and none of the seven lists the Algarve. The one on AI is a national IAPMEI call for AI training for companies under COMPETE2030, worth 80 million euros, planned for 30 October to 30 December 2026, for Alentejo, Centro and Norte only. For the Algarve the spreadsheet has 16 ALGARVE2030 calls (the web page's filter showed 18). The business and innovation ones are SIAC Empreendedorismo Qualificado associado ao conhecimento (1 million euros, 30 September 2026 to 15 January 2027), SIAC Qualificação (500,000 euros, to 29 January 2027), SIAC Transferência do conhecimento científico e tecnológico and SIAC Descarbonização (500,000 euros each, 30 October 2026 to 26 February 2027), hiring of highly qualified staff by firms (1.5 million euros, 1 October 2026 to 30 June 2027) and SICE Inovação Produtiva (listed at zero). The national business R&D call SIID I&D Empresarial (40 million euros, 30 September to 31 December 2026) includes the Algarve. All are forecasts, not launched notices, and keyword matching on titles is a rough test.",
