-    "lede": "Cá em Castro Marim the salt dries in the sun and the AI, ó pá, still has to be asked to come up from the car park.",
-    "mandate": "PrompTugal.news Castro Marim: we are the last town before Espanha, so we watch the AI coming over the Guadiana like a flamingo watching the tide. Salt pans, a council with a clever planning office and a family that taught a salt works to talk back. What comes from the Algarve, Portugal and the world gets weighed here like flor de sal, by the gram. Independent, and every fact has its source.",
-    "gravity": "Small town, big sky, lots of salt. Our money is in the pans of the Sapal, in visitors and in neighbourly dealings with Espanha across the river. Our AI, to be fair, is not a crowd, it is two cases: the Câmara tidying its planning papers with software that will one day answer citizens, and a salt family that built an app so clever it has an assistant.",
