+ "gravity": {
+  "text": "Faro is home to the Universidade do Algarve, whose campuses in the city anchor most of the region's AI activity: research (a 31.5 million euro archaeological innovation centre that will use AI), teaching (a published university AI policy, a health-AI executive course with a health-tech company), and the UALG TEC Campus where business events on AI are held. The community layer is also here: GDG Faro runs the city's developer conference on agentic AI, and Algarve Evolution, Algarve STP and the council add events and programmes. The municipality itself shows little AI use in what we could read, so innovation and research, not city government, is Faro's centre of gravity.",
