-    "cm-faro.pt/pt/noticias opened: 3 items, newest 2026-11-18 (walking cities network); none AI. Agenda lists 'Mentes artificiais, ola Futuro' and 'Novembro Digital' as events but no date or detail was read and a web search found nothing, so not added.",
-    "Opened cm-faro.pt/pt/noticias (2 items in window, newest 18 Nov: walkable cities network, diabetes training; no AI) and /pt/agenda/ (titles only; AI events Mentes artificiais and Novembro Digital already in file). ualg.pt/pt/noticias page 1: 10 items 16-19 Nov, newest 19 Nov; opened MetaRed TIC and immersive narratives items, neither mentions AI; Equipa UAlg already in file.",
-    "cm-faro.pt news 16-18 Nov (Rede de Cidades que Caminham, diabetes training): no AI; agenda items Mentes artificiais and Novembro Digital already in file; ualg.pt 17-19 Nov items (MetaRed TIC meeting, Walking on Ice immersive film): articles do not mention AI, not added; UAlg news 16 Nov (Equipa UAlg) already present [The ualg.pt items are as read on 19 Nov; ualg.pt was not read on 20 Nov: its robots.txt disallows AI crawlers.]",
-    "Opened cm-faro.pt/pt/noticias: 3 items, newest 2026-11-18; none AI. Agenda: 22 events; only two with AI/digital themes, both already in the file (Mentes artificiais, Novembro Digital). Semana dos Artistas, Micro-Folie not AI. robots.txt respected.",
-    "robots.txt read (Disallow only /upload_files/, /upload/). /pt/noticias/: 3 items, newest 18 Nov 2026 (walking cities network), none AI. /pt/agenda/: 22 entries; AI-related ones (Mentes artificiais 1-30 Nov, Novembro Digital 6-30 Nov) already in file; 24, 27, 28 Nov entries (UATI, Promenade, writing club, Moby Dick, repair workshop, organ festival, family Saturday) show no AI link, so not added. Agenda pages carry no descriptions.",
