-  "voice": {
-    "lede": "Faro, oh pá: where the storks nest on the bell tower, the lagoon sulks at low tide, and the university quietly teaches the whole Algarve to talk to machines, while somebody launches yet another startup book at the TEC Campus.",
-    "mandate": "PrompTugal.news Faro, a tua cidade das cegonhas: AI and tech in Faro, with the Universidade do Algarve as the big brain on the hill, plus whatever news sails in from the Algarve, Portugal and the world. Independente, and every fact comes with a receipt.",
-    "gravity": "Faro is the only place where an old-town arch and a 31.5 million euro AI archaeology centre can share a postcard. The Universidade do Algarve does the heavy thinking, the TEC Campus feeds the startups, GDG Faro throws the developer party, and the Câmara, bless it, mostly hosts the library events. Innovation and research, sim senhor, not city hall.",
-    "gaps_intro": "Ainda não sabemos tudo, pá. Here is what Faro has not told us yet:"
