+  "mandate": "PrompTugal.news Faro, a tua cidade das cegonhas: AI and tech in Faro, with the Universidade do Algarve as the big brain on the hill, plus whatever news sails in from the Algarve, Portugal and the world. Independente, and every fact comes with a receipt.",
