+  "No AI company is confirmed as headquartered in Lagos. A directory lists one small firm, but a directory entry is not a source we trust, and the Algarve AI startups we found (such as one in Monchique) are based elsewhere, so they belong to those towns. We should check the company register and Algarve Evolution's member list.",
+  "The council's news page, read on 15 November 2026, lists its twenty latest items, from 16 October to 13 November, and none is about AI or technology. It shows no feed and no year on its dates, so the council is a source to watch, not one that feeds us AI news yet.",
+  "No upcoming Lagos AI event was found. Meetup and Luma listings, where the local groups post, are not read by this publication, so the groups' own pages are the source to look for.",
+  "The Lagos Digital Nomads and Lagos Remoters membership figures could not be read from a page we may use, so none are given. We want a dated figure from the groups' own sites.",
+  "CoLagos's own site and Postal do Algarve showed a verification wall when we tried them, so we relied on Barlavento.",
+  "A summit page we read points to a 2027 edition, but we found nothing confirming the 2026 edition.",
+  "Local media: Barlavento and Sul Informação were readable, Portugal Resident and Postal do Algarve are listed but our tool could not open them (a verification wall). No Lagos-only newspaper or blog with a feed was confirmed.",
+  "Investors, cooperatives and local talent in Lagos: nothing found yet in public sources we may use.",
+  "Starting a company in Lagos: the council's page on the Fábrica do Empreendedor dates from June 2021, so its address and services need confirming on a current page. We found no official page on what Algarve STP offers a founder in Lagos.",
+  "One AI agency that works with Lagos clients states it has no office in Lagos, so it is not on the map. A directory-listed firm also stays off.",
+  "The 14 October 2026 SheSapiens workshop page gives its title and price only, so we cannot say what it taught. We also found no Lagos AI event dated after it."
