+  "gravity": "Lagos is where the Algarve's techies turn up in person, and bem. The council co-hosted the Algarve Tech Hub Summit here in November 2025 and teams up with GDG Lagos on AI nights and DevFest. CoLagos, the town's coworking space, has been full since November 2023, and the nomad crowd has been around since the pandemic. A real AI company with its head office in Lagos? We have not found one yet, so the town's strength is its people, not a cluster of firms.",
