-    "cm-tavira.pt returned HTTP 403 on 16 November, so no council press release, minutes or official contact page was read; the six new items come from Barlavento and Postal. Next: gov.pt, Diário da República, CCDR Algarve and IPMA for the flood-risk coverage.",
